---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PartnerBadges from '../../components/PartnerBadges.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "Sephra Europe: 1149% ROAS Case Study",
      "description": "How Visible Ads achieved 1,149% ROAS and £2.31M in conversion value for Sephra Europe through strategic Google Ads management.",
      "url": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/blog/sephra-europe-case-study",
      "datePublished": "2026-03-14",
      "dateModified": "2026-04-21",
      "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": "Boh Tjarks" },
      "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Visible Ads", "url": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com" },
      "image": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/images/visible-ads-og.png"
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blog", "item": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/blog" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Sephra Europe Case Study", "item": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/blog/sephra-europe-case-study" }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout title="Sephra Europe: 1149% ROAS Case Study | Visible Ads" description="How Visible Ads achieved 1,149% ROAS and £2.31M in conversion value for Sephra Europe through strategic Google Ads management." schema={schema}>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-navy-light relative overflow-hidden" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-5"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <nav class="text-sm text-slate-light mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Blog</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-white">Sephra Europe Case Study</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-electric/20 text-electric-light text-sm font-medium rounded-full mb-6">Case Study</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-6">Sephra Europe: 1,149% ROAS and £2.31M in Ad-Driven Revenue</h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-light leading-relaxed">How strategic Google Ads management transformed Chocolate Fountain Warehouse's D2C trajectory — achieving a 146% increase in ads-driven sales while improving efficiency.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Results -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-8">Key Results at a Glance</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
        <div class="bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-3xl font-heading font-extrabold text-electric mb-2">1,149%</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">ROAS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-3xl font-heading font-extrabold text-electric mb-2">£2.31M</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Conversion Value</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-3xl font-heading font-extrabold text-electric mb-2">146%</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Increase in Ad-Driven Sales</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Visible Ads transformed Chocolate Fountain Warehouse's (trading as Sephra Europe) eCommerce trajectory, achieving a remarkable 1,149.25% ROAS for their UK <a href="/google-ads" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">Google Ads</a> campaigns throughout the 2025 calendar year. By strategically managing £201k in ad spend, the agency generated £2.31M in conversion value — a £1.372M increase over 2024.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Managing Director David Archer describes Visible Ads as a "trusted partner" whose expertise delivered "outstanding performance" and "exceptional" business growth. Overall, the client grew from approximately £5M in 2022 to almost £20M in 2025, supported by strong B2B channels across all major UK supermarkets.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Strategy -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">Strategy and Objectives</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">The primary objective was to transform Chocolate Fountain Warehouse from digital stagnation into a high-growth D2C and small business leader. Three core goals drove the campaign:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong>Maximising Visibility:</strong> Revitalising their online presence through targeted paid search</li>
        <li><strong>Scaling Profitably:</strong> Continuously increasing ad budget while maintaining strict minimum ROAS targets across both Google and Amazon</li>
        <li><strong>Driving High-Value Sales:</strong> Achieving over 1,000% ROI on Google Ads, ensuring profitable growth based on the client's 24% net product margin</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Audience Targeting</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Visible Ads identified and targeted two primary segments: high-income households (retail customers) and professional catering businesses. Custom audiences were built using first-party data (existing customer emails), competitor website visitors, previous converters, and specific in-market and affinity audiences.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Channel and Keyword Strategy</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Performance Max campaigns were deployed for each product category, capturing demand from Shopping ads at the bottom of the funnel through to consideration and desire stages. Keyword targeting and custom audiences targeting competitor traffic were implemented as additional signals using bottom-funnel keywords for each category.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Optimisation -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">Optimisation and Execution</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Always-On A/B Testing</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">A rigorous three-step cycle was applied to all Performance Max asset groups: clone the original, replace the two weakest headlines, descriptions, images, and videos with fresh variations based on top performers, then benchmark the new group against the original on CTR and CPA. This permanent process eliminated creative fatigue across all campaigns.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Rule-Based Budget Management</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">A disciplined scaling framework ensured successful campaigns grew while underperformers were mitigated quickly:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong>10% weekly increase</strong> for campaigns exceeding 900% ROAS target</li>
        <li><strong>20% weekly increase</strong> for high performers exceeding 1,200% ROAS</li>
        <li><strong>Immediate budget reduction</strong> for any campaign falling below 500% ROAS</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Conversion Rate Optimisation</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">The strategy extended beyond the click. Visible Ads improved <a href="/amazon" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">Amazon</a> hero listings and eCommerce product detail pages with better media assets, implemented product ratings, and worked with the client on promotional ad extensions to increase conversion likelihood.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Real-Time Reporting</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Full accountability was maintained through weekly email reports, monthly PDFs, and a custom-built live ROAS dashboard for senior management. Shorter feedback cycles enabled the team to scale spend on high-ROAS campaigns and reduce spend on underperformers consistently.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Commercial Impact -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">Commercial Impact</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b-2 border-electric/20">
              <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Metric</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">2024</th>
              <th class="py-3 pl-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">2025</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-gray-700">
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Ad Spend</td><td class="py-3 px-4">~£95K</td><td class="py-3 pl-4">£201K</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Conversion Value</td><td class="py-3 px-4">~£938K</td><td class="py-3 pl-4">£2.31M</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="py-3 pr-4">ROAS</td><td class="py-3 px-4">9.87x</td><td class="py-3 pl-4">11.49x (1,149%)</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">YoY Revenue Increase</td><td class="py-3 px-4">—</td><td class="py-3 pl-4">+£1.372M (+146%)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">These results were achieved with a total management fee of just £1,000 per month, split across four PPC accounts (UK and USA). Isolating the £250 monthly fee for UK Google Ads, the campaign delivered a 184.8x return on agency fee — generating £184.80 in net profit for every £1 invested in management.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">The incremental return was even more striking: £109.76 in additional profit for every £1 of fee, representing a 10,976% incremental return on the year-on-year growth alone.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partner Badges -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-white border-y border-gray-100" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <PartnerBadges compact />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 bg-navy" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-5"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6">Want Results Like Sephra Europe?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-light mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Get a free audit of your Google Ads account and see where your next growth opportunity is.</p>
      <a href="/free-ads-audit" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-cta text-white font-semibold px-10 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-electric transition-colors text-lg">Get Your Free Ads Audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
